# KiCad autosave, backup, and lock files
**/#auto_saved_files#
**/_autosave-*
**/*-backups/
**/fp-info-cache
**/*.kicad_prl
**/~*.lck
**/*.bak

# KiCad backup/history folder (nested git repo made by an autosave plugin -
# not a real submodule, just noise that keeps showing as "modified")
**/.history/

# STM32CubeIDE build output and IDE-local metadata (regenerated on every
# build/regenerate, not needed in the repo)
STM32Cube/**/Debug/
STM32Cube/**/Release/
STM32Cube/**/.settings/
STM32Cube/**/.metadata/
STM32Cube/**/.mxproject

# Python bytecode cache
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# CMake build output at repo root (VSCode CMake extension default dir)
/build/
